<p><strong>The Christmas Tea reservation request form is now closed.</strong> Thank you for your patience as we process and respond to the reservation requests. A member of our team will contact everyone by email who submitted a request. Please allow a week for our team to review and process the high number of requests. We anticipate sending these emails by Wednesday, November 12 at 5 pm.</p>
